<Legal title="Privacy policy" description="Privacy policy and personal data handling for nathan-lallier.com.">
  <Fragment slot="titre">Privacy <span class="highlight">policy</span></Fragment>
<p class="lead">This is an English translation provided for convenience. The <a href="/politique" hreflang="fr" lang="fr">French version</a> is the legally binding one. Last updated January 2026.</p>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">1</span>Introduction</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>This privacy policy explains how personal data is collected, processed and protected on <a href="/en">nathan-lallier.com</a>.</p><p>Nathan LALLIER is committed to keeping the personal data users share confidential and to processing it in line with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the French Data Protection Act.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">2</span>Data controller</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>The controller of personal data is:</p><p><strong>Nathan LALLIER</strong><br/>Email: <a href="mailto:contact@nathan-lallier.com">contact@nathan-lallier.com</a></p><p>As controller, Nathan LALLIER determines the purposes and means of processing personal data.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">3</span>Data collected</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>The following personal data is collected on this website:</p><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Data</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Legal basis</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Last name, first name</td><td>Replying to contact requests</td><td>Consent</td></tr><tr><td>Email address</td><td>Communication and follow-up</td><td>Consent</td></tr><tr><td>IP address</td><td>Statistics and security</td><td>Legitimate interest</td></tr><tr><td>Browsing data</td><td>Improving the website</td><td>Legitimate interest</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</section>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">4</span>How data is used</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>Personal data is used to:</p><ul><li>Reply to messages sent through the contact form</li><li>Keep the website running and secure</li><li>Produce anonymous visitor statistics</li><li>Improve the user experience</li></ul><p>Data is <strong>never sold, traded or rented</strong> to third parties for commercial purposes.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">5</span>Retention periods</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>Personal data is kept for a limited time:</p><ul><li><strong>Contact data</strong>: 3 years from the last contact</li><li><strong>Browsing data</strong>: 13 months maximum</li><li><strong>Cookies</strong>: 13 months maximum</li></ul><p>After these periods, data is deleted or anonymised.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">6</span>Cookies</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>The contact form uses Google reCAPTCHA, which may set third-party cookies. It only loads once you have accepted cookies, and you can change your choice at any time with the “Manage cookies” link at the bottom of each page.</p><p>You can also disable cookies in your browser settings, although some features may then stop working. More information:</p><ul><li><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Chrome</a></li><li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/cookies-information-websites-store-on-your-computer" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Mozilla Firefox</a></li><li><a href="https://support.apple.com/en-gb/guide/safari/sfri11471/mac" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Safari</a></li><li><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/delete-cookies-in-microsoft-edge-63947406-40ac-c3b8-57b9-2a946a29ae09" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Microsoft Edge</a></li></ul></div>
</section>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">7</span>Your rights</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>Under the GDPR, you have the following rights over your personal data:</p><ul><li><strong>Access</strong>: confirm whether your data is processed and obtain a copy</li><li><strong>Rectification</strong>: correct inaccurate or incomplete data</li><li><strong>Erasure</strong>: have your data deleted in certain cases</li><li><strong>Restriction</strong>: limit how your data is processed</li><li><strong>Portability</strong>: receive your data in a structured format</li><li><strong>Objection</strong>: object to the processing of your data</li></ul><p>To exercise these rights, contact me at:</p><div class="info-badge"><span><a href="mailto:contact@nathan-lallier.com">contact@nathan-lallier.com</a></span></div></div>
</section>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">8</span>Data security</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>Nathan LALLIER takes appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect personal data:</p><ul><li>Secure HTTPS connection</li><li>Hosting on the secure GitHub Pages infrastructure (GitHub, Inc.)</li><li>Restricted access to personal data</li><li>Regular security updates</li></ul></div>
</section>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">9</span>Complaints to the CNIL</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>If, after contacting me, you believe your rights have not been respected, you can lodge a complaint with the French data protection authority (CNIL).</p><div class="info-badge"><span><a href="https://www.cnil.fr/en/complaints" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">www.cnil.fr</a></span></div></div>
</section>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">10</span>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>This policy may be updated at any time to reflect changes in practices or for operational, legal or regulatory reasons.</p><p>Significant changes will be clearly indicated on the website. The date of the last update is shown at the top of this page.</p></div>
</section>
</Legal>
